    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d316">

                <pb facs="1367" n="1209" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1209"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Persian Minister to the Assistant Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Persia</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-02-08"><hi rendition="#italic">February 8,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Assistant Secretary of State</hi>: I have the
                    honor to send you herewith the note concerning the matter about which the
                    minister for foreign affairs has just telegraphed me and over which I had the
                    honor to talk with you at our last interview.</p>
                <p>With great reliance on your good offices to bring about a favorable answer, and
                    thanking you in advance, I beg you to accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morteza.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d316-a1.xml" xpointer="d316-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
